---
title: "judging_pipeline (Sherlock Watsons)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_contest_end: audit contest ends
    q_contest_end --> q_phase1: Phase 1 - Real-Time Judging begins
    q_phase1 --> q_rt_duration: duration = max(num_issues / 100, 2) days
    q_rt_duration --> q_dedicated_judge: dedicated judges review all issues
    q_dedicated_judge --> q_community_vote: community judges vote severity + duplication
    q_community_vote --> q_signal_weight: votes weighted by judge signal score
    q_signal_weight --> q_controversial_flag: controversial issues flagged
    q_controversial_flag --> q_phase1_end: real-time judging ends
    q_phase1_end --> q_phase2: Phase 2 - Lead Judge review
    q_phase2 --> q_lj_duration: duration = max(num_issues / 200, 2) days
    q_lj_duration --> q_lj_review: lead judge reviews controversial issues only
    q_lj_review --> q_lj_explain: lead judge writes explanation for each judgment
    q_lj_explain --> q_preliminary: Checkpoint - Preliminary Results Announced
    q_preliminary --> q_phase3: Phase 3 - Escalation Period (24 hours)
    q_phase3 --> q_escalate_check: watsons may escalate issues
    q_escalate_check --> q_pay_signal: escalation costs signal (2 signal, requires >= 100)
    q_pay_signal --> q_add_comment: watson leaves rationale comment
    q_add_comment --> q_phase3_end: escalation period ends
    q_escalate_check --> q_phase3_end: no escalations
    q_phase3_end --> q_phase4: Phase 4 - Final Judgments
    q_phase4 --> q_p4_duration: duration = max(controversial_issues / 20, 2) days
    q_p4_duration --> q_lj_final: lead judge reviews all controversial + escalated issues
    q_lj_final --> q_sherlock_monitor: sherlock judge monitors, may overturn if clearly wrong
    q_sherlock_monitor --> q_final: Checkpoint - Final Results Announced
    q_final --> [*]: judging complete

    note right of q_phase1
        INV-001: Real-time judging starts immediately after contest ends
        INV-002: Duration = max(num_issues / 100, 2) days
        INV-003: 90% of issues typically judged within 12-24 hours
    end note

    note right of q_phase2
        INV-004: Lead judge duration = max(num_issues / 200, 2) days
        INV-005: Lead judge focuses on controversial issues only
        INV-006: Lead judge may begin before official start date
    end note

    note right of q_phase3
        INV-007: Escalation window = exactly 24 hours
        INV-008: Escalation costs 2 signal, requires >= 100 signal
    end note

    note right of q_sherlock_monitor
        INV-009: Sherlock judge only overturns if decision is clearly wrong
        INV-010: Lead judge has final authority on all issues
    end note
